    "quote": "For the $N$-armed stochastic bandit problem, Thompson Sampling algorithm has expected regret $$\\Ex[{\\cal R}(T)] \\leq O\\left(\\left(\\sum_{a=2}^N\\frac{1}{\\Delta_a^2}\\right)^2 \\ln T\\right)$$ in time $T$, where $\\Delta_i=\\mu_1-\\mu_i$."
